# 6x7 Christmas tree in the lobby ficus's pot: a warm star (`9`), fir tiers
# (`l`/`L`), two strings of lights (`9` lit, `o` dark) that swap each frame.
@frame 0
. . 9 9 . .
. . l L . .
. l 9 L l .
. L l o L .
l o L l 9 L
. . g g . .
. . g g . .
@frame 1
. . 9 9 . .
. . l L . .
. l o L l .
. L l 9 L .
l 9 L l o L
. . g g . .
. . g g . .
